# 🏡 Airbnb Pricing, Location & Listing Characteristics Analysis

### AnalystLab Africa | Track B – Data Science

## 📌 Project Overview

Welcome to my Airbnb Data Science project, developed as part of **AnalystLab Africa – Track B: Data Science**.

This project investigates Airbnb listing characteristics, advertised accommodation prices, room-type distributions and review activity across ten international cities.

Using Python, Pandas, NumPy, Apache Spark and Databricks, I explore how accommodation characteristics relate to advertised prices and examine patterns within different Airbnb markets.

The project combines exploratory data analysis (EDA), statistical hypothesis testing and data visualisation to transform large datasets into meaningful analytical insights.

**The central research question is:**

> How does advertised Airbnb listing price vary across room types within each city?

Supporting research questions investigate accommodation capacity, review activity and aggregate listing ratings.

